# SUPABASE SCHEMA SYNC RULE

Imajica will connect to a **dedicated Supabase project** later. Until then, services may use localStorage/demo data — but the **database schema must stay current**.

## When building or changing any feature that stores or loads data

You MUST update Supabase SQL in the same change set:

1. Add or alter tables/columns in a new file under `supabase/migrations/` (timestamped, never rewrite applied history casually).
2. Update `supabase/seed.sql` when demo/default rows are needed.
3. Add or adjust RLS policies for new tables/columns.
4. Match TypeScript types in `src/types` and service field names to SQL (`snake_case` in DB).

## Current feature → table map (keep updated)

| App area | Tables / notes |
|---|---|
| Auth / roles | `profiles` (+ `status`), `user_roles`, `roles` (`BRANCH_ADMIN` = Clinic Manager; `HR` = org-wide people ops on HQ sentinel), helpers `is_hr` / `is_people_ops`, views `v_team_user_access` / `v_user_access_directory`, RPC `set_profile_active` |
| Branches / settings | `branches` (+ `branch_type`), `branch_hours`, `branch_rooms`, `system_settings`; RPC `set_branch_active` |
| Team / recruitment & LMS | `recruitment_applicants` (+ `current_stage`, `source`, pipeline statuses), `recruitment_stage_events` (timeline), `new_hires` (onboarding checklist + docs from Hired), storage bucket `new-hire-docs`, `training_materials` + `training_material_assignees` + `training_material_progress` (employee completion), storage `training-materials`, `lms_courses`, `lms_enrollments` |
| Customer registration & list | `clients` (+ occupation, middle_name, emergency_*, medical_*, avatar_url, admin_notes), `client_skin_profiles`, `client_notes` |
| Client Scheduling | `appointments`, `appointment_status_history` (statuses include `no_show`, `pending`, `completed`, …) |
| Landing Special Offers | `landing_promos` (Marketing admin → landing modal slider) |
| Catalog services & packages | `treatments` (+ sessions, default_branch_id), `packages` (+ free_items, default_branch_id), `package_items`, `branch_treatments` |
| Catalog products / categories / consumables | `inventory_items` (+ category_id), `product_categories`, `consumables` |
| Administration operations | `operational_expenses`, `branch_orders`, `franchise_orders`, `waste_logs`, `warehouse_items` + `warehouse_stock_movements`, `stock_transfers`, `imajica_forms` (+ client_name, form_type, template_file, field_values, signatures) |
| Sales / payments | `sales` (+ `invoice_number`, `payment_type`, `booking_ref`, `referred_by_*`, `doctor_*`, `staff_name`, `lead_source`), `sale_items` (+ `unit_cost`, `sku`), `payments`; `clients.reward_points`; RLS: HQ + **people-ops/HR** + clinic branch scope |
